(6632306, 990746, 10785, '<td valign="top">I think you did well with this. I like the rim light to separate the background. I think the model is posed well for a headshot. There are a couple of things to critique about this too though. I do think the main light is just a touch too direct. Judging from the shadow on the eyeglass frames, I think a diffuser is needed. Yet you did manage to eliminate any glare which is great. Also the choice of black background kind of conflicts with the bright and cheery model.</td>', 'I think you did well with this. I like the rim light to separate the background. I think the model is posed well for a headshot. There are a couple of things to critique about this too though. I do think the main light is just a touch too direct. Judging from the shadow on the eyeglass frames, I think a diffuser is needed. Yet you did manage to eliminate any glare which is great. Also the choice of black background kind of conflicts with the bright and cheery model.', '2012-01-02 19:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6632308, 990170, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the lighting overall.  I don''t like the post-processing artifacts in the background (they stand out like brush strokes).</td>', 'I like the pose and the lighting overall.  I don''t like the post-processing artifacts in the background (they stand out like brush strokes).', '2012-01-02 19:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6632310, 990691, 10785, '<td valign="top">This definitely needs a crop to get rid of all the space above the head. Good choice using a shallow DoF to blur the busy background. Try to find a simpler background to let the subject stand out more. He does seem to be darker than the background. Possibly using a reflector could help him to be lit better.</td>', 'This definitely needs a crop to get rid of all the space above the head. Good choice using a shallow DoF to blur the busy background. Try to find a simpler background to let the subject stand out more. He does seem to be darker than the background. Possibly using a reflector could help him to be lit better.', '2012-01-02 19:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6632313, 990747, 10785, '<td valign="top">The photo is quite noisy and not very sharp. It is possibly cropped in too much. The model sure is happy!</td>', 'The photo is quite noisy and not very sharp. It is possibly cropped in too much. The model sure is happy!', '2012-01-02 19:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
