(6634121, 990498, 35086, '<td valign="top">Composition seems to need a bit of work, but that''s just my opinion.  Also the left side of his face is over saturated, drawing way too much attention to that part of the picture and throws the image off.  <br/> <br/>I don''t mean to say it''s bad, it''s pretty good, with ideal DOF, good direction and shadows.</td>', 'Composition seems to need a bit of work, but that''s just my opinion.  Also the left side of his face is over saturated, drawing way too much attention to that part of the picture and throws the image off.   I don''t mean to say it''s bad, it''s pretty good, with ideal DOF, good direction and shadows.', '2012-01-04 04:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634122, 990773, 35086, '<td valign="top">I like it and definitely a fitting title for this shot.</td>', 'I like it and definitely a fitting title for this shot.', '2012-01-04 04:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634125, 990717, 35086, '<td valign="top">Seems like the model is too tight within the frame, I like the relief it creates but I''m not sure it works well for a portrait.  Also the tones of blue and red doesn''t seem to work very well together here.</td>', 'Seems like the model is too tight within the frame, I like the relief it creates but I''m not sure it works well for a portrait.  Also the tones of blue and red doesn''t seem to work very well together here.', '2012-01-04 04:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634126, 990495, 35086, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Love the irony, the quality, the contrast, light.. just a great shot, not so much a classic portrait but that doesn''t seem to matter much in this case, I guess.</td>', 'I love this.  Love the irony, the quality, the contrast, light.. just a great shot, not so much a classic portrait but that doesn''t seem to matter much in this case, I guess.', '2012-01-04 04:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634127, 990020, 35086, '<td valign="top">Pretty good shot.  Not liking the harsh shadows behind her and the line of sight might have worked better for me if she had been looking on the other side of the frame.  But it''s certainly not bad at all.  :)</td>', 'Pretty good shot.  Not liking the harsh shadows behind her and the line of sight might have worked better for me if she had been looking on the other side of the frame.  But it''s certainly not bad at all.  :)', '2012-01-04 04:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634128, 990090, 35086, '<td valign="top">Very intense expression; I like this a lot.  Liking the blueish tone too.</td>', 'Very intense expression; I like this a lot.  Liking the blueish tone too.', '2012-01-04 04:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
