(6634216, 990461, 72929, '<td valign="top">This one will ribbon. Stood out among the thumbnails as a striking, high contrast portrait, with depth to the lighting. Also helps the subject is easy on the eyes, which will always improve voting scores. In this case, however, this setup would make a portrait of me look good ;)</td>', 'This one will ribbon. Stood out among the thumbnails as a striking, high contrast portrait, with depth to the lighting. Also helps the subject is easy on the eyes, which will always improve voting scores. In this case, however, this setup would make a portrait of me look good ;)', '2012-01-04 07:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
