(6634919, 990639, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait, filled with life and love.  How a family portrait ought to be, but rarely is at least to this splendid level. Thank you (and I bet they thanked you, too).</td>', 'Beautiful portrait, filled with life and love.  How a family portrait ought to be, but rarely is at least to this splendid level. Thank you (and I bet they thanked you, too).', '2012-01-04 16:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634920, 990498, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific picture, excellent model, great decision to use the landscape format.  A genuinely appealing portrait.  Thank you.</td>', 'Terrific picture, excellent model, great decision to use the landscape format.  A genuinely appealing portrait.  Thank you.', '2012-01-04 16:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634924, 990495, 30364, '<td valign="top">Clever;  nearly a wee bit twee, but you just avoided it!  Reminds me of the golden age of musical cinema, for some reason.  So I expect that he might suddenly start singing about how high the corn is, or something.  But I am toying with a very fine photograph so I''ll shut up and just say I really enjoyed your picture and I thank you for it.</td>', 'Clever;  nearly a wee bit twee, but you just avoided it!  Reminds me of the golden age of musical cinema, for some reason.  So I expect that he might suddenly start singing about how high the corn is, or something.  But I am toying with a very fine photograph so I''ll shut up and just say I really enjoyed your picture and I thank you for it.', '2012-01-04 16:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634929, 990357, 30364, '<td valign="top">Is this a very good portrait because he looks like a very nice bloke, or does he look like a very nice bloke because it''s such a very good portrait?  Either way, you did a great job here.  Thank you.</td>', 'Is this a very good portrait because he looks like a very nice bloke, or does he look like a very nice bloke because it''s such a very good portrait?  Either way, you did a great job here.  Thank you.', '2012-01-04 16:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634934, 990485, 30364, '<td valign="top">Unusual, and all the more memorable and powerful for that.  The sense of mild apprehension is perfectly communicated on both sides of the lens.  Thank you.</td>', 'Unusual, and all the more memorable and powerful for that.  The sense of mild apprehension is perfectly communicated on both sides of the lens.  Thank you.', '2012-01-04 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634937, 989735, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this in several quite different ways so far, and it hasn''t run out of possibilities yet.  I truly love open pictures like this.  Thank you.</td>', 'I''ve seen this in several quite different ways so far, and it hasn''t run out of possibilities yet.  I truly love open pictures like this.  Thank you.', '2012-01-04 16:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634944, 990661, 30364, '<td valign="top">Crickey, I hardly know what to say.  I''ll think about it for a bit and have another go then.</td>', 'Crickey, I hardly know what to say.  I''ll think about it for a bit and have another go then.', '2012-01-04 16:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6634948, 990717, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t see why ''not''.  It''s very interesting.  A portrait in profile has a long history of legitimacy, and they''re still fun these centuries later.  Thank you.</td>', 'I don''t see why ''not''.  It''s very interesting.  A portrait in profile has a long history of legitimacy, and they''re still fun these centuries later.  Thank you.', '2012-01-04 17:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
