(6635618, 990672, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo.  I love the black and white and think it really adds to the photo.  I''m a little  at odds with the eyes.  At first I thought it was some photoshop effect, but then I realize it was just a busy area behind the photographer.  Really great shot. 8</td>', 'I think this is a great photo.  I love the black and white and think it really adds to the photo.  I''m a little  at odds with the eyes.  At first I thought it was some photoshop effect, but then I realize it was just a busy area behind the photographer.  Really great shot. 8', '2012-01-05 09:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6635619, 990067, 56828, '<td valign="top">Like the texture in the photo and a strong manly pose.  Good shot...</td>', 'Like the texture in the photo and a strong manly pose.  Good shot...', '2012-01-05 09:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6635620, 990771, 56828, '<td valign="top">People are probably give you crap about the mask...quite frankly i like the mask.  It ads a little mysteriousness to the photo and puts focus on the eyes.  Great shot.</td>', 'People are probably give you crap about the mask...quite frankly i like the mask.  It ads a little mysteriousness to the photo and puts focus on the eyes.  Great shot.', '2012-01-05 09:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6635621, 990461, 56828, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the eyes and the gorgeous blue in them.  this is a great capture.  I like how you used the blur to put focus directly on her face.</td>', 'The contrast of the eyes and the gorgeous blue in them.  this is a great capture.  I like how you used the blur to put focus directly on her face.', '2012-01-05 10:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
