(6637148, 990714, 91783, '<td valign="top">i think its a little under exposed. just imo..</td>', 'i think its a little under exposed. just imo..', '2012-01-06 19:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637149, 990711, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like it. I find the selective focus perhaps a tad too strong, particularly on her lips. While I like the Lawrence of Arabia hood (sorry, probably not the best definition) and the crop as it is leaves space for her to gaze through. But I feel a tigher crop, excluding the white background completely, would have made for a stronger image and enhanced the complementary tones of skin and fabric. But probably it''s just me.</td>', 'I like it. I find the selective focus perhaps a tad too strong, particularly on her lips. While I like the Lawrence of Arabia hood (sorry, probably not the best definition) and the crop as it is leaves space for her to gaze through. But I feel a tigher crop, excluding the white background completely, would have made for a stronger image and enhanced the complementary tones of skin and fabric. But probably it''s just me.', '2012-01-06 19:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637155, 990730, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and pose. Perhaps I find the crop a bit too large, in that so much of the image is taken by the black background, but I guess it''s very subjective and the effect might be deliberate.</td>', 'I like the lighting and pose. Perhaps I find the crop a bit too large, in that so much of the image is taken by the black background, but I guess it''s very subjective and the effect might be deliberate.', '2012-01-06 19:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637158, 990741, 49018, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this would have worked in BW. I feel the red cast on his face is a bit too strong and a more neutral rendition might have worked better, but it might be my monutor oversaturating.</td>', 'I wonder how this would have worked in BW. I feel the red cast on his face is a bit too strong and a more neutral rendition might have worked better, but it might be my monutor oversaturating.', '2012-01-06 19:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637172, 990352, 49018, '<td valign="top">The subject and pose are both very expressive and the pendant suggests something about a story. Given the choice of going for high detail all over the image, I feel the out of focus little finger is a bit out of place. To be honest, this kind of processing and contrast are well over the top for my taste, but that''s just my taste, I am sure many will love it.</td>', 'The subject and pose are both very expressive and the pendant suggests something about a story. Given the choice of going for high detail all over the image, I feel the out of focus little finger is a bit out of place. To be honest, this kind of processing and contrast are well over the top for my taste, but that''s just my taste, I am sure many will love it.', '2012-01-06 19:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637176, 989962, 49018, '<td valign="top">Scratchy wool, I hated it as a child..</td>', 'Scratchy wool, I hated it as a child..', '2012-01-06 19:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637177, 990796, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice rimlight on the hair.</td>', 'Nice rimlight on the hair.', '2012-01-06 20:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637179, 990750, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good light and choice of framing.</td>', 'Good light and choice of framing.', '2012-01-06 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637206, 990712, 49018, '<td valign="top">Good expression, professional lighting and a very photogenic subject. Personally I am not too fond of this kind of postprocessing, so popular with magazines,  but it''s full of presence, very well done and I am sure many will just love it. A very good job of retaining detail on the zippers. I think if they were not visible and the crop was slightly tigher on the sides, still retaining negative space on the left, it would make for a more personal portrait. But it''s not a criticism, just a thought. Good job!</td>', 'Good expression, professional lighting and a very photogenic subject. Personally I am not too fond of this kind of postprocessing, so popular with magazines,  but it''s full of presence, very well done and I am sure many will just love it. A very good job of retaining detail on the zippers. I think if they were not visible and the crop was slightly tigher on the sides, still retaining negative space on the left, it would make for a more personal portrait. But it''s not a criticism, just a thought. Good job!', '2012-01-06 20:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637213, 990065, 49018, '<td valign="top">Ohh, I have seen this charming little lady before :) Very cute and diffraction works well here. I am unsure whether cloning out the specks from the glass would have been an improvement or not.</td>', 'Ohh, I have seen this charming little lady before :) Very cute and diffraction works well here. I am unsure whether cloning out the specks from the glass would have been an improvement or not.', '2012-01-06 20:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637216, 989866, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice high key. I wonder if it would have been better with more contrast in the bubbles, or perhaps it''s just my monitor having trouble showing subtle shades of gray. Illumination is very even works well with low contrast. I am unsure whether a slightly lighter shadow under her neck would have worked better or not.</td>', 'Nice high key. I wonder if it would have been better with more contrast in the bubbles, or perhaps it''s just my monitor having trouble showing subtle shades of gray. Illumination is very even works well with low contrast. I am unsure whether a slightly lighter shadow under her neck would have worked better or not.', '2012-01-06 20:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637219, 990714, 49018, '<td valign="top">Hello madam :) Nice expression. I wonder if a slight boost in brightness would have helped.</td>', 'Hello madam :) Nice expression. I wonder if a slight boost in brightness would have helped.', '2012-01-06 20:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637220, 990063, 49018, '<td valign="top">Quite personal portrait, I like it.</td>', 'Quite personal portrait, I like it.', '2012-01-06 20:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637225, 990584, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the subject. I feel a softer light and less harsh contrast would have worked better.</td>', 'I like the pose and the subject. I feel a softer light and less harsh contrast would have worked better.', '2012-01-06 20:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637226, 989912, 108069, '<td valign="top">Drastic improvement in B&amp;W.<br/> <br/>But still horrible.</td>', 'Drastic improvement in B&W. But still horrible.', '2012-01-06 20:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637227, 990461, 108069, '<td valign="top">Stunning and electric. Nicely done.</td>', 'Stunning and electric. Nicely done.', '2012-01-06 20:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637231, 990723, 49018, '<td valign="top">Urban portrait. A bit on the dark side. I wonder if making the image a bit brighter by increasing luminosity or playing around with the channels mixer could have improved contrast without excessive posterization. If the intention was to capture the urban environment as well, posing the subject in slow shutter speed in front of the passing cars could have worked quite well.</td>', 'Urban portrait. A bit on the dark side. I wonder if making the image a bit brighter by increasing luminosity or playing around with the channels mixer could have improved contrast without excessive posterization. If the intention was to capture the urban environment as well, posing the subject in slow shutter speed in front of the passing cars could have worked quite well.', '2012-01-06 20:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637233, 990749, 49018, '<td valign="top">Environmental portrait, I like the idea. If anything, I find the colors and processing a bit too intense. Given there is so much in terms of contrast to the image, particularly in the exposed roots and shadows, I wonder how a BW version would have worked.</td>', 'Environmental portrait, I like the idea. If anything, I find the colors and processing a bit too intense. Given there is so much in terms of contrast to the image, particularly in the exposed roots and shadows, I wonder how a BW version would have worked.', '2012-01-06 20:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637237, 990145, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the expression and the subject. I find the post processing too intense in the way it smoothed the skin and generally detail. Wrinkles on the elderly can be quite photogenic, actually.</td>', 'I like the expression and the subject. I find the post processing too intense in the way it smoothed the skin and generally detail. Wrinkles on the elderly can be quite photogenic, actually.', '2012-01-06 20:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637245, 990747, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice smile and expression, quite personal. The flash catchlight in the eyes is a bit too prominent. The colour noise is quite strong, particularly in the hair, and the image could have benefitted from desaturating it. I am guessing this is either an extreme crop or an image taken with a digicam, perhaps a phone. With an external flash, bouncing from the wall could have been a good options, particularly if precenting direct flash light from falling on the lady (people can come up with amazing stuff by masking the flash with a piece of black foam or even their hand). The red on her jumper and surroundings is one of the most difficult hues to retain detail in with most cameras. Blurring the background a bit without losing too much xmas details, so to fake a shallow depth of field, could have helped enhancing the subject.</td>', 'Nice smile and expression, quite personal. The flash catchlight in the eyes is a bit too prominent. The colour noise is quite strong, particularly in the hair, and the image could have benefitted from desaturating it. I am guessing this is either an extreme crop or an image taken with a digicam, perhaps a phone. With an external flash, bouncing from the wall could have been a good options, particularly if precenting direct flash light from falling on the lady (people can come up with amazing stuff by masking the flash with a piece of black foam or even their hand). The red on her jumper and surroundings is one of the most difficult hues to retain detail in with most cameras. Blurring the background a bit without losing too much xmas details, so to fake a shallow depth of field, could have helped enhancing the subject.', '2012-01-06 21:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637255, 990455, 49018, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lightpainting and interesting idea, probably a bit too alternative for voters to reward  it :) It actually reminds me of the fallen kings in Lord of the Rings, with the gaping mouth. I would be curious to know how this was done. Interesting take and out of the box, well done!</td>', 'Beautiful lightpainting and interesting idea, probably a bit too alternative for voters to reward  it :) It actually reminds me of the fallen kings in Lord of the Rings, with the gaping mouth. I would be curious to know how this was done. Interesting take and out of the box, well done!', '2012-01-06 21:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637259, 990170, 49018, '<td valign="top">Quite natural portrait. I am not sure the frame helps or not, perhaps the image would be better without. Definetely, a tigher crop including only the upper half of the image would have improved the it considerably for me, making for an interesting composition with his arms and hands leading to his eyes. But probably it''s just my taste.</td>', 'Quite natural portrait. I am not sure the frame helps or not, perhaps the image would be better without. Definetely, a tigher crop including only the upper half of the image would have improved the it considerably for me, making for an interesting composition with his arms and hands leading to his eyes. But probably it''s just my taste.', '2012-01-06 21:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637260, 990797, 49018, '<td valign="top">Funny :) I feel a softer, more diffused lighting, or at least a reflector lifting shadows under her chin, would have improved image considerably.</td>', 'Funny :) I feel a softer, more diffused lighting, or at least a reflector lifting shadows under her chin, would have improved image considerably.', '2012-01-06 21:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637263, 990680, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the smile, quite personal. Not sure about the sepia. I wonder if a brighter BW treatment would have been better, but probably it''s just my taste.</td>', 'I like the pose and the smile, quite personal. Not sure about the sepia. I wonder if a brighter BW treatment would have been better, but probably it''s just my taste.', '2012-01-06 21:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637265, 990400, 49018, '<td valign="top">Cute image. I might be wrong, but it looks to me like her skin as smoothed in prostprocessing. If that''s the case, perhaps it was a bit excessive.</td>', 'Cute image. I might be wrong, but it looks to me like her skin as smoothed in prostprocessing. If that''s the case, perhaps it was a bit excessive.', '2012-01-06 21:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637270, 990775, 49018, '<td valign="top">Probably it''s just my taste, but I feel a much tigher crop could have worked better in giving her more presence. Or perhaps just a framing which would leave some space on the right for her to gaze through. But probably it''s just me.</td>', 'Probably it''s just my taste, but I feel a much tigher crop could have worked better in giving her more presence. Or perhaps just a framing which would leave some space on the right for her to gaze through. But probably it''s just me.', '2012-01-06 21:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637272, 990401, 49018, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing. Perhaps a softer light (bouncing flash froma  wall?) would have given a less hars contrast and more modelling shadows.</td>', 'Interesting framing. Perhaps a softer light (bouncing flash froma  wall?) would have given a less hars contrast and more modelling shadows.', '2012-01-06 21:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637274, 990485, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very personal and expressive. The moody light works well here.</td>', 'Very personal and expressive. The moody light works well here.', '2012-01-06 21:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637275, 990325, 49018, '<td valign="top">I love the expression of the two ladies. I find the treatment a bit too contrasty.</td>', 'I love the expression of the two ladies. I find the treatment a bit too contrasty.', '2012-01-06 21:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637277, 989762, 49018, '<td valign="top">Well captured.</td>', 'Well captured.', '2012-01-06 21:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
