(6637291, 990196, 49018, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the BW treatment, it works well for the image on the whole, I am just uncertain about the tone of the lips.</td>', 'I like the idea and the BW treatment, it works well for the image on the whole, I am just uncertain about the tone of the lips.', '2012-01-06 21:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637293, 990717, 49018, '<td valign="top">We hear often of framing, but framing by colours is definetely less common. Very graphical and effective, it reminds me of film photography, which is always a good thing. Soem people might point out the softness as a negative point, but honestly I am not bothered in the least. 9</td>', 'We hear often of framing, but framing by colours is definetely less common. Very graphical and effective, it reminds me of film photography, which is always a good thing. Soem people might point out the softness as a negative point, but honestly I am not bothered in the least. 9', '2012-01-06 21:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637297, 990504, 49018, '<td valign="top">Nice expression and colours rendition. I like the refraction, the tension in her lips and the almost inquisitive gaze in her eyes. 8</td>', 'Nice expression and colours rendition. I like the refraction, the tension in her lips and the almost inquisitive gaze in her eyes. 8', '2012-01-06 21:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
