(6637799, 990065, 12076, '<td valign="top">A non-voting lurker here...   What a super photo!  Maybe the blur on her left cheek is a minor distraction, I don''t know.  Love the shot though.  Portrays emotion and wonder; creates some of the same in the viewer too.  At least for me.</td>', 'A non-voting lurker here...   What a super photo!  Maybe the blur on her left cheek is a minor distraction, I don''t know.  Love the shot though.  Portrays emotion and wonder; creates some of the same in the viewer too.  At least for me.', '2012-01-07 15:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6637874, 990691, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little too much headroom maybe.</td>', 'A little too much headroom maybe.', '2012-01-07 18:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
