(6639466, 990721, 125275, '<td valign="top">There''s lots of good in this, but the yellow was too much for my taste too. Rembrant is one of my favorite artists, and for that matter I did like the textured version on flickr a bit better. I also pulled this into PS and set the neutral point in a curves layer to about 3/4 the way up your collar (then dropped the opacity of that curves layer to about 75%), anyway, that looked a lot better IMO, and it balanced the blue a lot more. Actually, I didn''t too much notice the blues before I did that. Hope that helps!<br/>Classic pose also, except part of me really wants that to be a bubble pipe. Ha!</td>', 'There''s lots of good in this, but the yellow was too much for my taste too. Rembrant is one of my favorite artists, and for that matter I did like the textured version on flickr a bit better. I also pulled this into PS and set the neutral point in a curves layer to about 3/4 the way up your collar (then dropped the opacity of that curves layer to about 75%), anyway, that looked a lot better IMO, and it balanced the blue a lot more. Actually, I didn''t too much notice the blues before I did that. Hope that helps!Classic pose also, except part of me really wants that to be a bubble pipe. Ha!', '2012-01-09 00:10:30.000000', NULL, 0),
