(6639484, 990712, 125275, '<td valign="top">I do love the processing and lighting in this. It''s almost impossible to imagine doing this without a softbox. Is it possible?? (I don''t own one.) I had a similar idea, but didn''t do it for lack of time. I wanted a heavier sharpened look, close up and intimate like yours, and a lot more gritty. Therefore, I''m curious as to the post-processing of this.</td>', 'I do love the processing and lighting in this. It''s almost impossible to imagine doing this without a softbox. Is it possible?? (I don''t own one.) I had a similar idea, but didn''t do it for lack of time. I wanted a heavier sharpened look, close up and intimate like yours, and a lot more gritty. Therefore, I''m curious as to the post-processing of this.', '2012-01-09 00:15:45.000000', NULL, 0),
