(6639802, 990060, 49018, '<td valign="top">Three faces to one person, do they actually like each other or do they just found themselves together and get along?<br/>Do our sides convive happily and pacifically within the constraint vignette of our personality, or rather just ignore each other as far as possible? :)<br/>And dangerous, rough seas astonishingly absent under the ruthlessly stark sun.<br/> <br/>"one that cries, one that smiles, one says hello, one says goodbye, one does things I don''t understand , makes me feel like an half man"<br/>Such a different take from Springsteen''s in this image, or perhaps not.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-01-09 10:32:40.</i></td>', 'Three faces to one person, do they actually like each other or do they just found themselves together and get along?Do our sides convive happily and pacifically within the constraint vignette of our personality, or rather just ignore each other as far as possible? :)And dangerous, rough seas astonishingly absent under the ruthlessly stark sun. "one that cries, one that smiles, one says hello, one says goodbye, one does things I don''t understand , makes me feel like an half man"Such a different take from Springsteen''s in this image, or perhaps not.', '2012-01-09 10:14:28.000000', '2012-01-09 10:32:40.000000', 0),
