(6640236, 990691, 49018, '<td valign="top">Personally I don''t find this a bad portrait at all, for sure Jorge has an interesting face and the surroundings give some context.<br/>Postprocessing could have improved the colours considerably. Also, but I am not sure it would work in this case, if you work with lightroom acting on the greens (desat, hue shift, luminance) could have diminished the prominence of the chair without compromising your main subject.<br/>Given that acts on the whole image, it''s probably legal as per advanced editing.</td>', 'Personally I don''t find this a bad portrait at all, for sure Jorge has an interesting face and the surroundings give some context.Postprocessing could have improved the colours considerably. Also, but I am not sure it would work in this case, if you work with lightroom acting on the greens (desat, hue shift, luminance) could have diminished the prominence of the chair without compromising your main subject.Given that acts on the whole image, it''s probably legal as per advanced editing.', '2012-01-09 17:42:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6640244, 990784, 49018, '<td valign="top">As a teenager and then an adult with some problems waking up in the morning, I can only sympathize. And parents fiddling around with cameras (in my dad''s case, with fishing nets and rods, at 5 in the morning) do not help :D A wonderful very true portrait. Good Job!</td>', 'As a teenager and then an adult with some problems waking up in the morning, I can only sympathize. And parents fiddling around with cameras (in my dad''s case, with fishing nets and rods, at 5 in the morning) do not help :D A wonderful very true portrait. Good Job!', '2012-01-09 17:49:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6640258, 990769, 50641, '<td valign="top">what an earnest expression... one could write a whole novel based on this photo.  love the glow.</td>', 'what an earnest expression... one could write a whole novel based on this photo.  love the glow.', '2012-01-09 18:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6640262, 990747, 49018, '<td valign="top">:D It''s funny revising my comments and seeing which one actually didn''t make any sense at all, as the one I left on this image.<br/>It actually dawned to me to finish with "or perhaps you have taken this witha 2,000 bucks camera and dressed it up as a lovely polaroid xmas snap straight from the ''80s", but then I decided not to.<br/>This said, I love her expression, so nice. And I loved so much your postal service entry :D<br/></td>', ':D It''s funny revising my comments and seeing which one actually didn''t make any sense at all, as the one I left on this image.It actually dawned to me to finish with "or perhaps you have taken this witha 2,000 bucks camera and dressed it up as a lovely polaroid xmas snap straight from the ''80s", but then I decided not to.This said, I love her expression, so nice. And I loved so much your postal service entry :D', '2012-01-09 18:19:32.000000', NULL, 0),
