(6640782, 990067, 30364, '<td valign="top">Ah!  This was very fine.  Still is, actually.  I did give it a decent score (7, which is very high for me), and meant to comment further but something happened.  My alarm didn''t go off.  The dog ate my comment.  The train was late out of Strathfield. One of those, anyway.  Sorry for my no show before now, and congratulations on a surprisingly but pleasingly high finish for such a very good picture :) <br/> <br/>I''ll always vote for more headroom, by the way.  Max Headroom.  Cropping it down closer would have risked mussing your hair (and I have much less hair than you too, so I know about these sensitive tonsorial cropping considerations).</td>', 'Ah!  This was very fine.  Still is, actually.  I did give it a decent score (7, which is very high for me), and meant to comment further but something happened.  My alarm didn''t go off.  The dog ate my comment.  The train was late out of Strathfield. One of those, anyway.  Sorry for my no show before now, and congratulations on a surprisingly but pleasingly high finish for such a very good picture :)  I''ll always vote for more headroom, by the way.  Max Headroom.  Cropping it down closer would have risked mussing your hair (and I have much less hair than you too, so I know about these sensitive tonsorial cropping considerations).', '2012-01-10 07:33:42.000000', NULL, 0),
