(6641946, 990801, 72894, '<td valign="top">If this is someone you know, buy a polarizer for your lens and shoot this again, learn to use it and see if you like the effect. Some don''t like to use a polarizer as it darkens the exposure a bit, but to be able to remove the reflection from the glasses would enhance the photo for me. Just my $ .02, your mileage may vary.</td>', 'If this is someone you know, buy a polarizer for your lens and shoot this again, learn to use it and see if you like the effect. Some don''t like to use a polarizer as it darkens the exposure a bit, but to be able to remove the reflection from the glasses would enhance the photo for me. Just my $ .02, your mileage may vary.', '2012-01-11 08:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
