(6642294, 990747, 66709, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mcaldo:</b></div><hr/><i> :D It''s funny revising my comments and seeing which one actually didn''t make any sense at all, as the one I left on this image.<br/>It actually dawned to me to finish with "or perhaps you have taken this witha 2,000 bucks camera and dressed it up as a lovely polaroid xmas snap straight from the ''80s", but then I decided not to.<br/>This said, I love her expression, so nice. And I loved so much your postal service entry :D </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Avg Vote Cast: 6.1031</td>', 'Originally posted by mcaldo: :D It''s funny revising my comments and seeing which one actually didn''t make any sense at all, as the one I left on this image.It actually dawned to me to finish with "or perhaps you have taken this witha 2,000 bucks camera and dressed it up as a lovely polaroid xmas snap straight from the ''80s", but then I decided not to.This said, I love her expression, so nice. And I loved so much your postal service entry :D   Avg Vote Cast: 6.1031', '2012-01-11 14:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
