(6648278, 990775, 64446, '<td valign="top">Don, It''s good to see you back around here...<br/>This is an amazing image. The wonderful light, nice blue skies and, of course, a beautiful model so expressive! Totally underrated and should be in the front page, imo - got a 9 from me.  Just trying to guess why the score wasn''t higher, maybe the oof trees and branches are still too proeminent, distracting from the subject.</td>', 'Don, It''s good to see you back around here...This is an amazing image. The wonderful light, nice blue skies and, of course, a beautiful model so expressive! Totally underrated and should be in the front page, imo - got a 9 from me.  Just trying to guess why the score wasn''t higher, maybe the oof trees and branches are still too proeminent, distracting from the subject.', '2012-01-18 02:25:19.000000', NULL, 0),
