(6691739, 990771, 69684, '<td valign="top">Impressive portrait! Great light and contrasts in B&amp;W.  Missed the voting of this challenge, but it would have been one of my favorites. Congrats with your ribbon! And my guess is this is one of the few images here at DPC with a 5 as lowest score. I''ll make a thread about that. Perhaps someone knows.<br/> <br/><i>Just browsing a little through the top-10 images of this year</i></td>', 'Impressive portrait! Great light and contrasts in B&W.  Missed the voting of this challenge, but it would have been one of my favorites. Congrats with your ribbon! And my guess is this is one of the few images here at DPC with a 5 as lowest score. I''ll make a thread about that. Perhaps someone knows. Just browsing a little through the top-10 images of this year', '2012-02-25 14:37:14.000000', NULL, 0),
